OL,3,ABoat carrying some 270 people capsizes
OL,4,Aoff northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger boat with some 270 people
OL,7,Fon board has capsized off northern
OL,8,FCyprus, with a search and rescue
OL,9,Foperation under way.
OL,11,FMurat Senkul, the mayor of the coastal
OL,12,Ftown of Kyrenia, told broadcaster CNN
OL,13,FTurk that 159 of those aboard had been
OL,14,Freached.
OL,16,F"The situation is very serious," he
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
