OL,3,ABoat carrying some 270 people capsizes
OL,4,Aoff northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vessel reportedly began taking on
OL,7,Fwater about four miles off the shore.
OL,8,FLocal television has broadcast images
OL,9,Fof the upside-down ferry in the water,
OL,10,Fwith people wearing life vests atop its
OL,11,Fhull.
